# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Private / personal: never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Spec, agent instructions and decision log (kept locally only)
doc/
# Source photos kept for reference (e.g. the owner's original photo)
originals/
# Secrets (NFR-31). .env.example is the only env file that is committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# AI assistant local settings and notes
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md

